WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
|||||\\\\\\\\\\\\\

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
Release-Group "Mania" presents
doramamania

00:00:25.560 --> 01:13:29.300
Mania

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.020
Alchemy

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.020
Shower

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:45.980
Who are you and why are you following me?

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:47.730
I'm asking...

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:51.150
Who are you?

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:13.050
Judging by the fact that you recognized the sword,

00:01:13.630 --> 00:01:14.840
you must be a magician

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:19.220
Put down your sword

00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:24.940
It's dangerous to draw Jeonbugwan's sword here.

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:29.980
This is the village of Gema

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:34.150
Mages of Jeonbugwan who come for magic are considered enemies here

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:37.070
If you get into a fight

00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:39.620
and people will know that you are here,

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:42.700
you'll be in danger

00:01:50.590 --> 00:01:51.710
It sounds like

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:54.470
like you know who I am

00:01:56.340 --> 00:01:58.640
You carry Jeonbugwan's gwangju sword

00:02:00.310 --> 00:02:01.900
I think you are his son

00:02:09.030 --> 00:02:12.240
Does Wook know what his father looks like?

00:02:14.790 --> 00:02:18.460
His father doesn't have portraits like his mother?

00:02:18.540 --> 00:02:20.920
We don't have gwangju portraits

00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:23.840
And the gentleman didn’t ask about him

00:02:24.710 --> 00:02:28.010
He only saw his father as a child, so he doesn't remember his face.

00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:31.390
He doesn't recognize his father

00:02:31.470 --> 00:02:33.140
even if he collides with him

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:39.600
I followed you only because I recognized the sword

00:02:44.190 --> 00:02:45.940
Do you know the owner of the sword?

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:52.140
Project coordinator and editor: Ria_Lee

00:02:48.530 --> 00:02:51.280
The man who left such a sword is crazy

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:57.140
Assistant coordinators: Martini, gaarysn

00:02:52.910 --> 00:02:54.950
His wife cheated on him and died

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:59.160
Afterwards he abandoned his own son, resigned from his post and disappeared

00:02:57.140 --> 00:03:02.140
Typesetter translators: Ria_Lee, Alina, Zero Amamiya

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:02.920
This crazy person is Chang Gang

00:03:07.050 --> 00:03:08.840
People say things like that about him behind his back.

00:03:09.630 --> 00:03:11.800
No one has ever said this to my face

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:14.930
Do you have your own scores to settle with him?

00:03:17.770 --> 00:03:18.890
What if so?

00:03:19.990 --> 00:03:22.950
Will you take revenge on me for your father?

00:03:26.990 --> 00:03:28.410
No

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:30.460
I won't, even if I'm his son

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:33.000
He wouldn't want that

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:38.090
Then why do you carry your father's sword with you?

00:03:38.170 --> 00:03:40.170
If I deny that he is my father,

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:42.260
my mom

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:44.720
will look pathetic

00:03:48.810 --> 00:03:49.930
Do Hwa...

00:03:53.650 --> 00:03:56.110
Do Hwa was the biggest victim

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:07.620
Do you know my mother too?

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:13.120
Do Hwa was the most beautiful woman in all of Daeho

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:18.050
Everyone in Daeho knew her

00:04:18.630 --> 00:04:21.720
It seems like everyone in my family is famous for something.

00:04:23.340 --> 00:04:24.720
I must say

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:28.350
I didn't expect to run into anyone here who might recognize me

00:04:56.430 --> 00:04:58.850
This is a place where people secretly practice magic,

00:04:58.930 --> 00:05:00.810
despite the ban on Sosnovy Bor

00:05:01.470 --> 00:05:05.270
What is Gwangju Jeonbugwan's son doing in a place like this?

00:05:05.350 --> 00:05:06.900
Well they told me I could

00:05:06.980 --> 00:05:10.070
see the magic of curses and souls here

00:05:10.150 --> 00:05:11.860
You are the magician of Jeongjingak,

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:14.400
and are interested in dark magic?

00:05:15.700 --> 00:05:16.780
Not really

00:05:17.910 --> 00:05:20.490
I'm here to find the shaman who uses this magic.

00:05:22.490 --> 00:05:23.580
"Shaman"?

00:05:24.450 --> 00:05:27.040
This shaman possessed the magic of the soul,

00:05:27.670 --> 00:05:29.630
who bewitched and drove people crazy

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:33.170
Twenty years ago she was caught

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:36.510
mages of Jeonbugwan, but she escaped after her house burned down

00:05:38.930 --> 00:05:40.930
What do you need from Shaman Choi?

00:05:41.430 --> 00:05:43.520
How did you know it was about her?

00:05:45.980 --> 00:05:49.560
And you, by chance, are not the magician of Jeonbugwan,

00:05:50.310 --> 00:05:51.940
who worked with my father?

00:05:53.860 --> 00:05:56.150
The Choi family was a family of magicians,

00:05:57.240 --> 00:06:00.500
which was destroyed by Master Seo Kyung a long time ago

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:04.670
Don't be nosy

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:08.130
If such interest consumes you,

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:12.220
the darkness of this magic will take over your soul,

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:14.180
and eventually you will lose everything

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:17.810
When this happens

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:20.690
there will be no turning back

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:30.320
Don't look for those who practice dark magic

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:33.490
The world doesn't approve of such things

00:06:34.530 --> 00:06:35.990
and you will not be forgiven

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:43.880
Wait

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:50.470
Here

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:57.430
Are you injured?

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:00.230
Yes, I'm wounded

00:07:02.020 --> 00:07:04.610
I'm wounded to the very depths of my soul

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:19.880
Is he like this because of dark magic?

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:52.210
Boo Young!

00:07:53.620 --> 00:07:54.790
Boo Young!

00:08:16.440 --> 00:08:19.070
Did she just look at me?

00:08:21.570 --> 00:08:23.030
Sorry

00:08:23.110 --> 00:08:25.240
Can you help me lift the crutch?

00:08:26.280 --> 00:08:28.580
This is the girl I ran into at the house

00:08:47.100 --> 00:08:48.400
Mother!

00:08:54.070 --> 00:08:55.030
Mother

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:57.780
Is she really Boo Young unnie?

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:01.120
Yes, that's your sister

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:03.750
unnie

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:12.000
Boo Young, I'll take you to your room

00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:47.210
You are Chan Wook's maid

00:09:47.870 --> 00:09:49.960
What are you doing here?

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:55.210
I came to help Miss Jin escape from home

00:09:55.300 --> 00:09:57.810
But it seems I'd better leave

00:09:57.890 --> 00:09:59.520
I'm already leaving

00:10:10.240 --> 00:10:11.870
What was Moo Deok doing here?

00:10:12.450 --> 00:10:14.280
I was sure she didn't recognize me

00:10:15.410 --> 00:10:17.200
Should I have just killed her?

00:10:18.710 --> 00:10:21.880
Boo Young, nothing has changed in your room.

00:10:22.630 --> 00:10:25.880
I knew that someday this day would come

00:10:37.220 --> 00:10:38.430
Let's go in

00:10:55.700 --> 00:10:57.950
All your things

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:00.540
still here

00:11:01.620 --> 00:11:04.170
Since I almost died in the lake,

00:11:05.630 --> 00:11:09.460
every evening I had to wander around in search of a place to sleep

00:11:10.220 --> 00:11:11.930
And now I have a room

00:11:15.640 --> 00:11:18.320
I didn't know that I had a mother who was waiting for me

00:11:21.150 --> 00:11:25.280
Every day I suffered and suffered

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:31.910
My poor child

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:35.710
Now you will be happy every day

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:38.550
Don't worry

00:11:42.420 --> 00:11:43.590
Mom

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:04.280
Did Jin Mu really find her daughter?

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:09.620
Yes. The girl opened the door to Jinyoung

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:12.580
- What?
- Did you open the doors?

00:12:12.660 --> 00:12:16.040
These doors cannot be opened by any tricks.

00:12:16.120 --> 00:12:19.540
Only the daughter of the Jin family is capable of this

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:27.220
So Jin Bu Young is back?

00:12:36.820 --> 00:12:40.450
Why do my eyes hurt so much every time I go to Jinyeowon?

00:12:47.710 --> 00:12:49.630
Is it because of their relics?

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:10.860
Moo Deok, what are you doing here?

00:13:11.980 --> 00:13:13.780
Did you look in the mirror?

00:13:17.740 --> 00:13:19.280
Did you want to become nicer to me?

00:13:20.530 --> 00:13:21.910
Don't talk nonsense

00:13:22.580 --> 00:13:23.700
Wait a minute

00:13:23.790 --> 00:13:25.580
I want to become nicer

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:29.170
Choose something suitable for your owner

00:13:31.960 --> 00:13:33.420
I'll choose it myself

00:13:38.300 --> 00:13:39.930
So how? Suits me

00:13:40.010 --> 00:13:42.970
Yes. You look great

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:45.640
Of course it suits me

00:13:46.520 --> 00:13:47.890
Let's see

00:13:50.060 --> 00:13:51.650
Oh and it fits

00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:53.610
It's hard to choose. Everything suits me

00:13:59.160 --> 00:14:00.500
What is this?

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:04.040
Give it to me. Now I'll paint you

00:14:09.920 --> 00:14:13.220
Look how cute he is

00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:16.100
I'm already cute enough

00:14:16.180 --> 00:14:17.680
now it's your turn

00:14:23.310 --> 00:14:25.190
How cute is our Moo Deok?

00:14:27.280 --> 00:14:30.320
Childish. I thought you only liked my eyes

00:14:30.400 --> 00:14:33.070
Exactly. I thought only the eyes were beautiful

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:37.040
But your poison played a cruel joke on me

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:38.950
Now I like you anyway

00:14:48.960 --> 00:14:52.590
I see how you try not to fall in love with me

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:53.680
It's hard for you

00:14:58.180 --> 00:15:00.480
But no. Not at all

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:07.570
If you're going to lie to my face, at least play better

00:15:07.650 --> 00:15:10.240
She blushed all over

00:15:12.990 --> 00:15:15.960
It's because of the blush!

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:17.170
Let me

00:15:19.920 --> 00:15:22.300
Apparently he went too far. Doesn't come off

00:15:25.430 --> 00:15:26.890
You are now

00:15:27.640 --> 00:15:30.270
you look like a drunk dog

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:36.940
Don't look like that, she looks like a dog about to bite

00:15:37.020 --> 00:15:39.360
I can really bite

00:15:41.570 --> 00:15:43.780
I won't bite. Sit down

00:15:47.280 --> 00:15:49.830
Come on, that's enough

00:15:53.080 --> 00:15:55.420
I had to buy this because of you

00:15:56.500 --> 00:15:59.790
If you don't like it, don't use it. I'll keep it for myself

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:03.130
That's cute too

00:17:05.240 --> 00:17:06.120
Moo Deok...

00:17:23.220 --> 00:17:24.850
You almost got run over

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:35.690
Moo Deok,

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:38.820
are you really drunk? Did you drink without me?

00:17:41.530 --> 00:17:44.410
I drank too. Maybe together now?

00:17:45.160 --> 00:17:46.740
I'm not drunk

00:17:47.660 --> 00:17:49.120
Did you go out for a drink?

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:52.000
I was in the village of Gema, they treated me there

00:17:52.580 --> 00:17:54.970
Did you meet shaman Choi there?

00:17:56.470 --> 00:17:58.930
Found a connection between her and Jin Mu

00:17:59.020 --> 00:18:01.850
And I also ran into the crown prince there

00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:03.690
With the prince?

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:07.190
He also suspects Jin Moo and the queen

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:16.030
Your Highness

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:19.250
Are you returning from Gema village?

00:18:20.330 --> 00:18:21.250
Yes

00:18:21.830 --> 00:18:24.670
The palace is like a labyrinth. I barely found my way

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:26.380
What?

00:18:26.920 --> 00:18:29.840
- Did something happen?
- Deputy Jin Mu is here

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:54.700
Where did you go alone, without guards?

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:58.580
I'm embarrassed that my outing didn't go unnoticed. Let's leave it out

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:03.000
I met His Majesty

00:19:03.710 --> 00:19:05.670
He mentioned the King's star again

00:19:07.590 --> 00:19:09.000
He's obsessed with her

00:19:09.090 --> 00:19:12.720
Give him at least a fake plaque with this star on it

00:19:12.800 --> 00:19:15.140
Then he will have to find everyone who was born that day

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:16.730
and kill

00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:19.650
Why?

00:19:20.150 --> 00:19:22.070
It could be a hero

00:19:22.150 --> 00:19:25.070
akin to Master Seo Kyung, not a traitor and conspirator

00:19:25.150 --> 00:19:27.660
They say Seo Kyung saved the world with an ice stone

00:19:27.740 --> 00:19:28.700
But that's not true

00:19:30.490 --> 00:19:33.000
Essentially, he controlled the world by forbidding everyone

00:19:33.080 --> 00:19:34.620
use this enormous power

00:19:35.620 --> 00:19:38.420
This stone creates dark magic, and it is dangerous.

00:19:38.500 --> 00:19:40.670
Sosnovy Bor thinks so

00:19:41.550 --> 00:19:45.050
Ice stone can bring eternity into our lives

00:19:46.260 --> 00:19:47.760
Let's stop growing old and dying

00:19:47.840 --> 00:19:51.510
His power will make us forever young and beautiful

00:19:51.600 --> 00:19:53.310
Are you talking about the alchemy of souls?

00:19:53.390 --> 00:19:55.310
Sosnovy Bor banned this magic

00:19:55.390 --> 00:19:56.940
What if the ban is lifted?

00:19:57.020 --> 00:19:58.940
and allow you to use the ice stone?

00:19:59.020 --> 00:20:00.110
Your Highness,

00:20:00.900 --> 00:20:02.610
What will happen then, what do you think?

00:20:06.030 --> 00:20:09.490
He who has the stone will live forever

00:20:10.700 --> 00:20:13.830
But it is dangerous to give such power to everyone

00:20:13.910 --> 00:20:15.790
Not for everyone

00:20:15.870 --> 00:20:18.620
We will issue a decree according to which only the chosen ones

00:20:18.710 --> 00:20:20.960
how can you, for example, use this magic

00:20:24.800 --> 00:20:26.630
Then we need to find a stone,

00:20:26.720 --> 00:20:29.340
to make this possible

00:20:30.010 --> 00:20:32.810
Jin Bu Young, Jinyoung's lost daughter, has returned

00:20:32.890 --> 00:20:34.900
- Jinewon?
- Woman,

00:20:34.980 --> 00:20:39.200
who helped Master Seo Kyung find the stone, was the first head of Jinyoewon

00:20:39.280 --> 00:20:41.490
And Jin Bu Young is so strong,

00:20:41.570 --> 00:20:43.370
like the first chapter

00:20:48.210 --> 00:20:51.130
If the ice stone appears, like two hundred years ago,

00:20:51.210 --> 00:20:53.040
Jinyoewon's heiress

00:20:54.250 --> 00:20:56.300
will find him right away

00:21:00.260 --> 00:21:02.550
Jinyoewon's eldest daughter returned alive

00:21:03.050 --> 00:21:05.930
She seems like an ordinary blind girl

00:21:06.640 --> 00:21:08.430
I thought she was incredibly strong

00:21:09.270 --> 00:21:10.690
Why did she lose strength?

00:21:10.770 --> 00:21:12.150
Although,

00:21:12.230 --> 00:21:15.230
She couldn’t find a house for ten years, so it’s possible

00:21:18.150 --> 00:21:21.740
Jin Mu brought her, everything can’t be clean there

00:21:21.820 --> 00:21:23.410
Did you notice anything strange?

00:21:26.830 --> 00:21:29.540
I once ran into her at your house

00:21:31.540 --> 00:21:34.290
I remember because I helped her lift her crutch.

00:21:36.590 --> 00:21:37.920
At my house?

00:21:38.010 --> 00:21:40.260
I didn’t notice anything strange about her then

00:21:40.340 --> 00:21:41.970
Today too

00:21:45.760 --> 00:21:46.720
Umbrella...

00:21:50.430 --> 00:21:52.440
She had an umbrella

00:21:52.520 --> 00:21:54.450
I've already seen it somewhere

00:21:55.030 --> 00:21:57.910
Umbrella? What's so special about an umbrella?

00:21:57.990 --> 00:21:59.040
That's not the point

00:21:59.120 --> 00:22:01.910
This umbrella is made of quality sheepskin and bamboo

00:22:02.710 --> 00:22:04.210
He was very expensive

00:22:05.420 --> 00:22:07.670
- How did he end up with her?
- What?

00:22:07.750 --> 00:22:09.340
Who did it belong to before?

00:22:11.590 --> 00:22:12.630
Umbrella?

00:22:13.220 --> 00:22:15.010
I don't have it

00:22:15.590 --> 00:22:17.050
Gave it to someone

00:22:17.140 --> 00:22:18.470
To whom and where?

00:22:19.270 --> 00:22:20.980
I didn't do it on purpose

00:22:21.060 --> 00:22:22.890
Sorry, you bought it for me

00:22:23.520 --> 00:22:25.100
I don't need an apology

00:22:25.600 --> 00:22:27.520
Did you give it to your girlfriend?

00:22:28.150 --> 00:22:30.150
Yes, girl

00:22:30.230 --> 00:22:31.240
Just don't be angry

00:22:32.950 --> 00:22:35.240
Why should I be angry?

00:22:35.320 --> 00:22:36.740
Who is this girl?

00:22:37.320 --> 00:22:38.330
A?

00:22:38.410 --> 00:22:40.870
Answer already! Tired of waiting

00:22:40.950 --> 00:22:42.790
Which girl did you give it to?

00:22:46.290 --> 00:22:47.840
Moo Deok

00:22:47.920 --> 00:22:50.340
That's not the right way to ask. Yul...

00:22:51.710 --> 00:22:53.920
He turned pale with fear

00:22:54.010 --> 00:22:56.300
You scold him like a wife who caught him cheating

00:22:56.390 --> 00:22:59.050
You can't ask in such a tone... demanding

00:22:59.890 --> 00:23:01.720
Watch and remember. Yul,

00:23:01.810 --> 00:23:04.690
did you give the umbrella to the blind girl?

00:23:05.440 --> 00:23:06.440
How did you know?

00:23:07.730 --> 00:23:10.690
Could it be So Yi who was mentioned before?

00:23:11.980 --> 00:23:14.160
Yes, I gave her the umbrella

00:23:14.250 --> 00:23:15.370
What?

00:23:16.420 --> 00:23:17.670
Today I was in Jinyowon

00:23:18.540 --> 00:23:20.670
There I saw their lost daughter Jin Bu Young

00:23:20.750 --> 00:23:22.340
She was blind

00:23:22.420 --> 00:23:24.670
but instead of a crutch she had an umbrella

00:23:25.590 --> 00:23:26.760
The same umbrella?

00:23:30.300 --> 00:23:31.180
Guys!

00:23:32.430 --> 00:23:34.060
Have you heard the news?

00:23:34.140 --> 00:23:37.440
Cho Young's older sister has been found. They found Jin Bu Young!

00:23:39.230 --> 00:23:40.270
A?

00:23:40.980 --> 00:23:42.730
What are these sour faces?

00:23:43.320 --> 00:23:44.780
What were you talking about?

00:23:44.860 --> 00:23:47.400
Oh So Yi, who we were looking for

00:23:48.030 --> 00:23:48.860
So Yi?

00:23:49.910 --> 00:23:51.120
That scammer?

00:23:51.700 --> 00:23:52.660
Did you find her?

00:23:52.740 --> 00:23:55.040
Jin Bu Young, who was brought by Jin Mu,

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:57.120
This is the scammer So Yi

00:23:57.920 --> 00:23:59.790
Apparently all those people were killed

00:23:59.880 --> 00:24:01.790
to hide who she is

00:24:17.520 --> 00:24:18.730
Jin Bu Young

00:24:22.730 --> 00:24:25.150
I will become an exact copy of you

00:24:42.760 --> 00:24:45.140
The headband is the same as Moo Deok's

00:24:48.310 --> 00:24:49.980
Why is she here?

00:24:51.900 --> 00:24:53.020
Boo Young!

00:25:01.200 --> 00:25:02.360
Did you find out...

00:25:03.490 --> 00:25:04.530
this bandage?

00:25:11.750 --> 00:25:13.790
Coat of arms of Jinyoewon

00:25:13.880 --> 00:25:17.130
I embroidered on all the headbands

00:25:17.880 --> 00:25:20.050
I was worried that something would happen to you,

00:25:20.130 --> 00:25:23.090
because you're blind

00:25:23.180 --> 00:25:27.510
That's why I made you wear a headband with our family crest on it.

00:25:30.060 --> 00:25:31.310
How's that?

00:25:35.560 --> 00:25:37.900
The bandage is old, but silk

00:25:38.570 --> 00:25:41.280
Your real parents are probably rich

00:25:43.780 --> 00:25:45.780
Are you really blind?

00:25:46.700 --> 00:25:48.700
I see everything, but I can’t find the stream

00:25:48.790 --> 00:25:50.910
But it's not difficult for you

00:25:53.550 --> 00:25:58.220
Boo Young, you have had the ability to sense energy since childhood.

00:25:58.930 --> 00:26:03.020
You were able to find things faster than sighted people

00:26:03.600 --> 00:26:06.440
I didn’t get confused on the way, I didn’t get lost

00:26:07.730 --> 00:26:10.150
Like Moo Dok in Sari Village

00:26:10.230 --> 00:26:13.200
She found things easily and always knew where to go.

00:26:13.280 --> 00:26:15.110
You were wearing the exact same bandage...

00:26:16.740 --> 00:26:19.580
the day you disappeared

00:26:20.740 --> 00:26:24.210
So I was hoping that you would use it

00:26:25.580 --> 00:26:26.920
to find my way home

00:26:28.040 --> 00:26:30.380
She always treated this bandage with trepidation

00:26:30.460 --> 00:26:32.920
Said it was the only way to find a home

00:26:34.680 --> 00:26:36.470
If you had kept it,

00:26:37.850 --> 00:26:40.930
I would recognize you immediately

00:26:42.020 --> 00:26:45.480
The headband I stole from Moo Deok was made by this woman.

00:26:46.600 --> 00:26:48.190
Thank you very much

00:26:48.270 --> 00:26:52.070
that she returned safe and sound, Boo Young

00:26:58.950 --> 00:27:01.540
The real Boo Young, the daughter of this woman...

00:27:02.290 --> 00:27:04.370
my friend Moo Deok

00:27:27.450 --> 00:27:28.660
Boo Young!

00:27:31.580 --> 00:27:35.080
Did Jinyoewon's doors open because of her?

00:27:37.210 --> 00:27:38.710
Moo Deok is the real Jin Bu Young

00:27:40.250 --> 00:27:42.710
What will happen to me if she finds out about this?

00:27:45.550 --> 00:27:47.010
Will they kill me?

00:27:52.970 --> 00:27:54.220
unnie

00:27:55.430 --> 00:27:56.930
What are you doing?

00:27:57.600 --> 00:27:59.020
Do you want to open the doors again?

00:27:59.100 --> 00:28:00.270
No

00:28:03.400 --> 00:28:06.610
I just can't believe that you are truly my family

00:28:07.820 --> 00:28:09.360
Don't worry

00:28:10.030 --> 00:28:11.200
Believe me

00:28:11.280 --> 00:28:14.200
We all saw you open the doors

00:28:17.870 --> 00:28:21.880
By the way, that girl who was with you last night...

00:28:21.960 --> 00:28:23.090
Are you talking about Moo Deok?

00:28:23.840 --> 00:28:25.300
She doesn't serve Jinyeowon

00:28:25.380 --> 00:28:28.630
Does she come here often? It seemed that mother knew her too

00:28:28.720 --> 00:28:30.430
Mother doesn't like her

00:28:30.510 --> 00:28:32.600
You see, she's nothing but trouble.

00:28:32.690 --> 00:28:33.980
Really?

00:28:36.280 --> 00:28:37.610
Apparently that's why...

00:28:37.690 --> 00:28:39.700
I felt negative energy

00:28:40.740 --> 00:28:43.200
Negative energy?

00:28:43.280 --> 00:28:47.200
The energy I felt was dark and unpleasant

00:28:48.080 --> 00:28:51.080
Stay away from people with that kind of energy

00:28:51.670 --> 00:28:54.790
She's not such a bad person

00:28:55.880 --> 00:28:57.210
Here you are, girls

00:28:59.380 --> 00:29:00.380
Dad

00:29:00.470 --> 00:29:01.380
Father

00:29:02.220 --> 00:29:03.930
Cho Young, mom is looking for you

00:29:04.510 --> 00:29:05.600
Mother?

00:29:07.010 --> 00:29:09.100
I thought she wasn't angry anymore

00:29:10.480 --> 00:29:12.980
- I went
- Okay

00:29:17.980 --> 00:29:20.530
I told you to stay away from my daughter.

00:29:21.280 --> 00:29:22.400
I'm sorry

00:29:23.320 --> 00:29:25.820
On the last day of the month we are expected in Jeonbugwan

00:29:25.910 --> 00:29:27.910
- Be ready
- Okay

00:29:29.330 --> 00:29:30.580
Father, wait

00:29:33.120 --> 00:29:34.370
Are you sure

00:29:37.000 --> 00:29:39.460
that Jin Bu Young is dead?

00:29:40.920 --> 00:29:43.340
What will happen to me if she comes back?

00:29:44.590 --> 00:29:46.550
Don't fill your head with such thoughts

00:29:48.970 --> 00:29:50.140
She's dead

00:29:59.700 --> 00:30:01.700
Even if Moo Deok is their real daughter,

00:30:01.790 --> 00:30:03.460
none of them know about it

00:30:04.620 --> 00:30:06.540
We can't let them find out

00:30:09.920 --> 00:30:11.380
I'm Jin Bu Young

00:30:23.560 --> 00:30:25.140
I thought about it all night

00:30:25.770 --> 00:30:28.060
It could jeopardize my love

00:30:28.150 --> 00:30:31.650
but I will fulfill my duty as the heir of Sosnovy Bor

00:30:31.730 --> 00:30:34.280
- I’ll go and tell my uncle everything.
- No

00:30:34.360 --> 00:30:37.660
You remember how he quarreled with Mrs. Jin?

00:30:37.740 --> 00:30:39.530
If we have no evidence

00:30:39.620 --> 00:30:42.240
Let's declare that her daughter is a false Bu Young and a murderer,

00:30:42.740 --> 00:30:45.000
relations with Jinyoung will deteriorate completely

00:30:46.210 --> 00:30:47.330
You're right

00:30:47.420 --> 00:30:51.340
If the truth comes out, war will break out between Jin Moo and Jinyeowon.

00:30:52.000 --> 00:30:54.510
We can't interfere until we find out everything.

00:30:56.470 --> 00:30:59.050
But why did they bring the fraudster...

00:30:59.140 --> 00:31:00.850
and declared that she was an heiress?

00:31:00.930 --> 00:31:03.020
Because they need their man in Jinyeowon

00:31:03.930 --> 00:31:05.060
What if she gets caught?

00:31:05.140 --> 00:31:07.140
Mother recognizes her child

00:31:07.230 --> 00:31:10.660
Eventually she will be caught. Why take such a risk?

00:31:11.450 --> 00:31:13.200
Because for him it's nothing

00:31:15.450 --> 00:31:17.040
Jin Mu must have something

00:31:17.120 --> 00:31:19.920
that will not allow Jin Ho Kyung to do anything,

00:31:21.080 --> 00:31:23.170
even if she recognizes the substitution

00:31:30.930 --> 00:31:32.510
There's something wrong with her

00:31:33.180 --> 00:31:38.060
She has the same scar and mole that Boo Young had.

00:31:39.440 --> 00:31:41.020
But the shape of the ears is different

00:31:42.770 --> 00:31:45.230
Ears never change

00:31:47.740 --> 00:31:49.740
Is my memory failing me?

00:31:51.870 --> 00:31:53.080
Sister

00:32:11.130 --> 00:32:12.840
For help with the search for Boo Young

00:32:13.390 --> 00:32:16.520
you asked permission to enter Jinyeowon, I'm surprised

00:32:17.180 --> 00:32:19.980
I wasn't allowed here

00:32:20.060 --> 00:32:22.230
although I am a member of the Jin family

00:32:22.310 --> 00:32:24.560
I punished you severely every time

00:32:25.400 --> 00:32:27.150
when you were approaching jinyeowon

00:32:28.900 --> 00:32:30.790
I was really too hard on you

00:32:31.540 --> 00:32:34.210
I hated you, although you appeared because of your father’s adventures

00:32:34.290 --> 00:32:36.670
Despised for all your diligent attempts

00:32:36.750 --> 00:32:38.670
please and please everyone around you

00:32:39.420 --> 00:32:40.760
Forgive me

00:32:44.550 --> 00:32:46.300
All this is in the past

00:33:04.410 --> 00:33:06.160
Now Boo Young is back

00:33:09.240 --> 00:33:12.250
Quickly declare her your heir

00:33:14.080 --> 00:33:17.790
Appoint Boo Young as the next head of Jinyoung?

00:33:18.300 --> 00:33:22.800
A new chapter will breathe life into Jinyeowon again

00:33:22.880 --> 00:33:24.010
And then

00:33:24.090 --> 00:33:28.100
I will make Jo Young the crown princess

00:33:32.310 --> 00:33:33.690
There's no need to rush

00:33:33.770 --> 00:33:35.980
Boo Young's memory has not yet returned

00:33:36.690 --> 00:33:39.150
And I’m still able to control Jinyeowon

00:33:39.230 --> 00:33:43.780
Your strength is not enough to find the ice stone

00:33:46.030 --> 00:33:48.160
When you carried Boo Young under your heart,

00:33:48.240 --> 00:33:51.170
you took the stone from Jinyowon and gave it to Jang Gang...

00:33:51.800 --> 00:33:53.130
to save her life

00:33:55.380 --> 00:33:57.930
How did you find out about this?

00:33:58.010 --> 00:33:59.220
No need to be scared

00:33:59.300 --> 00:34:01.560
I'm not trying to convict you of crimes

00:34:02.930 --> 00:34:05.980
I'm sure Chang Gang insisted on sealing the stone somewhere else

00:34:06.060 --> 00:34:07.600
He didn't give it back to you

00:34:08.520 --> 00:34:11.150
Do you know where he hid...

00:34:11.230 --> 00:34:12.900
ice stone from Jinyaewon?

00:34:12.980 --> 00:34:14.690
Jinyowon's heiress is here,

00:34:14.780 --> 00:34:18.910
so I'll put the stone back where it belongs

00:34:20.030 --> 00:34:22.450
Jin Mu, you...

00:34:22.540 --> 00:34:23.450
Sister,

00:34:23.540 --> 00:34:25.370
I just said I'll return it

00:34:26.120 --> 00:34:28.080
Don't look for a trick

00:34:28.170 --> 00:34:30.880
Think of it as a gift that came with Boo Young

00:34:30.960 --> 00:34:34.590
All that is required is to accept it with gratitude

00:34:54.150 --> 00:34:56.490
Sounds like you're asking

00:34:57.070 --> 00:35:01.070
blindly admit Boo Young if I want to get the stone

00:35:01.160 --> 00:35:04.620
Get rid of suspicions and doubts, then you will gain everything

00:35:05.700 --> 00:35:09.120
And the stone and the lost daughter

00:35:10.840 --> 00:35:12.470
What do you want?

00:35:16.600 --> 00:35:19.020
To protect the ice stone,

00:35:19.640 --> 00:35:21.770
crush Sosnovy Bor

00:35:23.480 --> 00:35:25.860
Do you want me to destroy Sosnovy Bor?

00:35:25.940 --> 00:35:27.570
The collapse of Sosnovy Bor

00:35:28.610 --> 00:35:32.160
will allow us to take possession of the full power of the ice stone

00:35:48.840 --> 00:35:50.840
Are you talking about the alchemy of souls?

00:35:50.930 --> 00:35:53.010
Sosnovy Bor banned this magic

00:35:54.220 --> 00:35:55.720
What if the ban is lifted?

00:35:55.810 --> 00:35:57.810
and allow you to use the ice stone?

00:35:57.890 --> 00:35:59.020
Your Highness,

00:35:59.770 --> 00:36:01.600
What will happen then, what do you think?

00:36:04.480 --> 00:36:06.320
Eternal life?

00:36:13.030 --> 00:36:15.450
Has the fossilization process stopped?

00:36:15.530 --> 00:36:17.990
Now he can breathe

00:36:19.120 --> 00:36:21.000
And move your fingers

00:36:21.830 --> 00:36:24.330
Master Kan was a magician with vast experience

00:36:25.130 --> 00:36:27.340
When did he become interested in witchcraft?

00:36:27.420 --> 00:36:30.600
If Jin Mu told me that I could move a soul

00:36:30.680 --> 00:36:33.520
in a young and beautiful body, I would peck

00:36:35.690 --> 00:36:39.610
Just kidding. But I'm sure many would fall for it

00:36:39.690 --> 00:36:41.190
People don't talk about it openly

00:36:41.280 --> 00:36:42.820
only because of Sosnovy Bor

00:36:44.780 --> 00:36:47.700
First Jeonbugwan and the palace

00:36:47.780 --> 00:36:52.080
Now it seems that Jin Mu's hands have reached Jinyowon as well.

00:36:52.160 --> 00:36:53.290
But we can

00:36:53.370 --> 00:36:56.710
prove that he used soul alchemy

00:36:56.790 --> 00:36:59.090
As soon as we interrogate Master Kahn,

00:36:59.170 --> 00:37:01.420
We can finally catch Jin Moo

00:37:02.010 --> 00:37:04.010
He's not afraid of getting caught

00:37:04.880 --> 00:37:06.680
On the contrary, he is plotting something again

00:37:08.140 --> 00:37:10.220
I can't even imagine

00:37:10.890 --> 00:37:13.350
how far is he willing to go

00:37:14.810 --> 00:37:16.270
And it scares me

00:37:24.070 --> 00:37:27.490
Why should I go to Jeonbugwan this time?

00:37:27.570 --> 00:37:30.620
Will you have to suffer again because of another worm?

00:37:30.700 --> 00:37:32.700
Just do what they say

00:37:34.660 --> 00:37:37.920
There will be a lot of people there. Watch what you say and do

00:38:03.240 --> 00:38:07.420
Today I will finally show you

00:38:09.080 --> 00:38:10.840
our danzhu

00:38:15.510 --> 00:38:19.300
Come forward and show yourself to everyone

00:38:37.900 --> 00:38:40.620
Our Danzhu is not only the most powerful priestess of Deho,

00:38:40.700 --> 00:38:43.790
but also the future head of Jinyeowon. Her name is Jin Bu Young

00:38:46.330 --> 00:38:48.710
Bow to Danzhu

00:39:04.140 --> 00:39:07.060
I will use it to reveal the ice stone to the world.

00:39:08.360 --> 00:39:10.240
And then I'll move my soul into her body

00:39:10.910 --> 00:39:14.030
Then I can be there and serve you,

00:39:15.120 --> 00:39:16.370
sister

00:39:31.340 --> 00:39:34.890
The head of Jinyeowon convened a Unified Council

00:39:34.970 --> 00:39:36.970
- You didn’t even discuss it with Sosnovy Bor?
- Yes

00:39:37.060 --> 00:39:40.270
She sent letters to all families. They're heading here now

00:39:43.810 --> 00:39:44.980
What's this time...

00:39:45.060 --> 00:39:48.860
is Jinyoewon going to pull this off?

00:39:54.370 --> 00:39:58.490
Her son is now in Sejukwon

00:40:02.120 --> 00:40:03.540
Why is everyone here?

00:40:05.290 --> 00:40:07.800
Jinyeowon convened the Unified Council

00:40:11.420 --> 00:40:12.840
Cho Young is here too

00:40:13.590 --> 00:40:16.220
The blind girl next to you is Boo Young?

00:40:17.350 --> 00:40:18.310
So Yi?

00:40:19.600 --> 00:40:20.520
Yes

00:40:23.900 --> 00:40:25.560
Everything is happening faster than we thought

00:40:25.650 --> 00:40:28.160
They're going to use fake Boo Young

00:40:28.240 --> 00:40:30.120
to do something today

00:40:38.420 --> 00:40:40.670
This must be Jin Bu Young

00:41:08.870 --> 00:41:11.290
The head of Jinyeowon invited the royal family

00:41:11.370 --> 00:41:14.660
and Jeonbugwan on the Unified Council

00:41:14.750 --> 00:41:16.370
Single advice?

00:41:18.210 --> 00:41:19.340
For what?

00:41:19.420 --> 00:41:21.340
To announce an important decision,

00:41:21.420 --> 00:41:24.380
which will determine the future of all Deho

00:41:33.680 --> 00:41:37.190
In the capital, real chaos broke out due to numerous cases,

00:41:37.270 --> 00:41:39.310
associated with nomads

00:41:39.400 --> 00:41:41.020
despite Nak Soo's return

00:41:41.820 --> 00:41:45.650
Therefore, Jinyeowon tried to help Sosnovy Bor,

00:41:45.740 --> 00:41:47.580
to find the source of witchcraft

00:41:48.710 --> 00:41:49.670
However...

00:41:51.210 --> 00:41:54.010
Our support was taken for granted

00:41:55.010 --> 00:41:59.970
and arrogantly put forward unreasonable demands and requests

00:42:02.140 --> 00:42:05.430
They broke into Jinyeowon as well as into Jeonbugwan,

00:42:05.520 --> 00:42:08.730
justifying themselves by saying that they are looking for traces of dark magic

00:42:08.810 --> 00:42:12.230
Moreover, they tried to use Jinyeowon's relics,

00:42:12.320 --> 00:42:14.150
to check all the magician families

00:42:14.230 --> 00:42:17.030
It’s as if everyone outside the walls of Sosnovy Bor is resorting to witchcraft

00:42:18.960 --> 00:42:20.070
Moreover,

00:42:20.160 --> 00:42:24.080
they brought one of our relics to the palace

00:42:24.580 --> 00:42:26.580
Sosnovy Bor doesn't trust us?

00:42:26.660 --> 00:42:28.000
This is too much

00:42:31.830 --> 00:42:33.710
Chief Jin, you have convened the Unified Council,

00:42:33.800 --> 00:42:36.920
to speak out and complain about Sosnovy Bor?

00:42:37.010 --> 00:42:37.970
You see for yourself

00:42:38.050 --> 00:42:40.340
As soon as I started talking,

00:42:40.430 --> 00:42:42.300
how he immediately rushes to shut me up

00:42:42.890 --> 00:42:44.930
I, Jin Ho Kyung, head of Jinyoewon

00:42:45.010 --> 00:42:49.770
I want to stop this outrage, allegedly committed to search for dark magic

00:42:49.850 --> 00:42:52.480
In this connection, I break the rule introduced 200 years ago,

00:42:52.560 --> 00:42:57.530
observed to this day. That's why I gathered you all here

00:43:01.280 --> 00:43:02.200
Boo Young

00:43:12.510 --> 00:43:16.970
Here is Jin Bu Young, heiress of Jinyoung,

00:43:17.060 --> 00:43:18.430
returned after 10 years

00:43:22.020 --> 00:43:23.270
I heard she found her daughter

00:43:23.860 --> 00:43:24.730
Apparently it's her

00:43:28.480 --> 00:43:31.530
I have something to show you, and my daughter

00:43:31.610 --> 00:43:34.200
will help me with this

00:43:46.130 --> 00:43:50.880
The pine forest was looking for ice stone everywhere,

00:43:50.970 --> 00:43:52.880
being the source of the alchemy of souls

00:43:52.970 --> 00:43:55.680
However, all this time, he was in Jinyowon

00:44:43.570 --> 00:44:45.490
So this is Jin Moo's plan

00:44:46.030 --> 00:44:49.330
Use Jinyeowon to introduce the ice stone to the world

00:44:49.410 --> 00:44:50.910
This is just the beginning

00:44:51.830 --> 00:44:55.290
Those who are suspected will try to move souls

00:44:58.210 --> 00:44:59.380
What are you talking about?

00:45:00.000 --> 00:45:01.000
Don't you understand?

00:45:01.590 --> 00:45:04.300
The ice stone was with the queen, but now it is with Jinyeowon

00:45:04.380 --> 00:45:06.260
This means that shaman Choi will leave the queen’s body

00:45:07.340 --> 00:45:09.510
and will migrate into the body of someone from Jinyoewon

00:45:12.310 --> 00:45:14.180
She will leave the queen's body

00:45:16.020 --> 00:45:19.730
and will migrate to the body of the future head of Jinyeowon,

00:45:21.020 --> 00:45:22.480
using soul alchemy

00:45:35.500 --> 00:45:37.210
The first one is very cute

00:45:37.920 --> 00:45:39.330
A unified council has been convened, they say

00:45:39.420 --> 00:45:41.880
They will talk about nomads

00:45:41.960 --> 00:45:43.670
Apparently

00:45:44.800 --> 00:45:47.640
Don't buy unnecessary jewelry. Better take gold

00:45:47.730 --> 00:45:50.230
In dark times you can only hope for gold

00:45:50.310 --> 00:45:53.150
There will be plenty of work to do when the council ends

00:45:53.230 --> 00:45:54.070
That's right

00:45:54.150 --> 00:45:56.570
They'll finish and everyone will go drinking right away.

00:45:56.650 --> 00:45:59.320
- People will tell nasty things about Sosnovy Bor
- Hey

00:45:59.410 --> 00:46:01.950
Stop touching everything, buy it already

00:46:02.030 --> 00:46:04.540
What's wrong with you? Give her time

00:46:04.620 --> 00:46:06.080
I want to buy everything

00:46:06.160 --> 00:46:08.160
- Let me try it on
- This one?

00:46:12.840 --> 00:46:15.420
Everyone in the capital is talking about the Unified Council

00:46:15.500 --> 00:46:17.300
yes about the royal family

00:46:18.300 --> 00:46:21.510
He'll have to come back because of all this fuss.

00:46:22.970 --> 00:46:24.720
Are you talking about Master Chan?

00:46:25.850 --> 00:46:30.230
I also thought it was strange that Dan Gu was asking me questions.

00:46:30.310 --> 00:46:32.020
about Mr. Chang Gang

00:46:32.100 --> 00:46:35.650
It seems that the head of Sosnovy Bor is waiting for his appearance

00:46:43.240 --> 00:46:44.910
Take this

00:46:44.990 --> 00:46:46.790
Give to Chang Gun when he appears

00:46:47.750 --> 00:46:48.830
What is this?

00:46:49.660 --> 00:46:50.790
Can I have a look?

00:47:01.680 --> 00:47:03.140
It's empty here

00:47:03.220 --> 00:47:07.020
Did you use the same spell as in Words of the Heart?

00:47:09.070 --> 00:47:12.610
When Chang Gang reads it, he will do what it says

00:47:19.040 --> 00:47:23.420
By the way, don't you need to attend the council?

00:47:24.000 --> 00:47:26.090
I am teacher Seo Kyung's student

00:47:27.590 --> 00:47:29.170
If I go there

00:47:29.260 --> 00:47:34.220
I can neither support nor condemn the actions of my teacher

00:47:40.310 --> 00:47:44.520
So Master Seo Kyung kept the ice stone?

00:47:44.600 --> 00:47:46.980
I thought he destroyed them all

00:47:47.060 --> 00:47:48.770
Did Sosnovy Bor know about this?

00:47:48.860 --> 00:47:51.110
If so, then everything that Sosnovy Bor did

00:47:51.190 --> 00:47:54.160
justified by the words of Master Seo Kyung, deception?

00:47:54.240 --> 00:47:56.740
- Nonsense!
- Yes, this is a real scam.

00:47:56.820 --> 00:47:58.780
They introduced so many rules for the families of magicians,

00:47:58.870 --> 00:48:01.370
explaining everything by saying that dark magic is being watched

00:48:01.450 --> 00:48:02.660
Am I wrong?

00:48:02.750 --> 00:48:05.000
- Exactly
- Everything is correct

00:48:05.080 --> 00:48:07.000
Was Pine Forest leading us by the nose?

00:48:07.080 --> 00:48:08.420
Were we fooled?

00:48:08.500 --> 00:48:10.880
- Were you really fooled?
- Calm down!

00:48:12.420 --> 00:48:13.630
Our magicians did not suspect...

00:48:13.720 --> 00:48:17.600
that the ice stone is kept in Jinyeowon

00:48:18.300 --> 00:48:20.350
We don't want to listen to your excuses

00:48:20.430 --> 00:48:21.770
We need to decide what's next

00:48:21.850 --> 00:48:25.700
to do with the stone that is left

00:48:25.780 --> 00:48:28.820
It must be destroyed. This is the source of witchcraft

00:48:29.330 --> 00:48:31.200
This is what Master So Kyung bequeathed

00:48:31.950 --> 00:48:33.450
We must destroy the stone...

00:48:34.290 --> 00:48:36.460
in front of everyone present

00:48:36.960 --> 00:48:39.790
He himself left the ice stone in Jinyeowon

00:48:39.880 --> 00:48:42.710
Let's follow his decision and leave the stone there

00:48:42.800 --> 00:48:46.090
Then there was no need to bring it here

00:48:46.180 --> 00:48:49.680
How can you sit still now that you have shown everyone that it exists?

00:48:49.760 --> 00:48:52.560
Are you trying to make Sosnovy Bor a laughing stock?

00:48:52.640 --> 00:48:55.430
The head of Jinyeowon speaks his mind

00:48:55.520 --> 00:48:56.980
She follows the master's will

00:48:57.060 --> 00:48:59.100
what the ice stone left in Jinyeowon

00:48:59.190 --> 00:49:03.900
Sosnovy Bor no longer has the right to tell us what to do with the ice stone

00:49:03.980 --> 00:49:07.740
Outrageous! Do you no longer care about the opinion of Sosnovy Bor?

00:49:08.320 --> 00:49:09.910
We came here to discuss...

00:49:09.990 --> 00:49:12.830
how to use the stone based on the will of Master Seo Kyung

00:49:12.910 --> 00:49:15.290
If Sosnovy Bor doesn't like something, leave

00:49:15.370 --> 00:49:16.910
- You're telling the truth
- Exactly

00:49:17.000 --> 00:49:19.330
You lied to us, so it’s not up to you to decide now

00:49:19.420 --> 00:49:22.090
- That's right, you don't have the right to vote
- Don't interfere

00:49:22.170 --> 00:49:23.380
If you're against it, leave

00:49:23.460 --> 00:49:25.840
- Just leave!
- Get out!

00:49:25.920 --> 00:49:27.300
So that's why Jin Mu...

00:49:27.380 --> 00:49:30.640
showed the ice stone to everyone

00:49:30.720 --> 00:49:33.640
Now the opinion of Sosnovy Bor is not justified,

00:49:33.720 --> 00:49:36.100
no one wants to listen to them

00:49:43.150 --> 00:49:44.480
What are you doing there?

00:49:45.080 --> 00:49:46.330
If Sosnovy Bor

00:49:46.410 --> 00:49:49.040
against the stone remaining in Jinyeowon,

00:49:49.580 --> 00:49:52.630
Shall we give it to a third party for storage?

00:49:53.590 --> 00:49:54.960
Here's my proposal

00:49:55.050 --> 00:49:56.960
Shall we move it to Jisan?

00:49:57.550 --> 00:49:59.380
What nonsense?

00:49:59.470 --> 00:50:01.340
Why is it going straight to Zhisan?

00:50:01.430 --> 00:50:03.100
You and your family are low level magicians!

00:50:03.180 --> 00:50:04.140
What did he say?

00:50:04.220 --> 00:50:07.020
Your family has no right to keep the ice stone

00:50:07.100 --> 00:50:09.020
- We are against
- We don’t have the right?

00:50:09.600 --> 00:50:12.810
Our family is the oldest in Daeho

00:50:12.900 --> 00:50:15.150
We have every right to protect the ice stone

00:50:15.230 --> 00:50:17.320
Where did you put your hands?

00:50:17.400 --> 00:50:20.030
-Are you looking for a fight?
- And myself!

00:50:20.110 --> 00:50:22.570
- What are you doing?
- Watch your language

00:50:23.160 --> 00:50:25.160
Who do you think you are?

00:50:25.240 --> 00:50:27.290
Small morel!

00:50:27.370 --> 00:50:28.830
Am I the morel?

00:50:28.910 --> 00:50:30.330
Hey, stop it!

00:50:30.410 --> 00:50:31.370
Out of the way!

00:50:35.340 --> 00:50:37.500
Hit me?

00:50:37.590 --> 00:50:39.630
Damn you, old man!

00:50:41.470 --> 00:50:42.800
Oh you...

00:50:42.890 --> 00:50:45.350
Take your hands off me, you idiot!

00:50:49.310 --> 00:50:50.480
Are you aiming at me?

00:50:50.560 --> 00:50:52.810
Great. Come on, attack

00:50:55.060 --> 00:50:55.980
You...

00:50:56.070 --> 00:50:58.190
Do you think I can't?

00:50:58.280 --> 00:50:59.650
Just as arrogant as you seem

00:50:59.740 --> 00:51:01.740
Whose cow would moo!

00:51:02.570 --> 00:51:04.830
Grandfather on the Unified Council?

00:51:04.920 --> 00:51:05.750
Yes

00:51:06.340 --> 00:51:09.420
I didn't find the textbook you asked for in Jeongjingak

00:51:10.170 --> 00:51:12.340
I'll go there and look for it myself

00:51:13.550 --> 00:51:15.720
The council is probably discussing something important

00:51:15.800 --> 00:51:18.680
All the magicians of Saejukwon went there

00:51:22.600 --> 00:51:26.110
They said my son is still alive

00:51:51.300 --> 00:51:52.380
Ji Ho...

00:52:11.400 --> 00:52:12.740
You're alive

00:52:21.450 --> 00:52:22.490
Ji Ho?

00:52:49.490 --> 00:52:51.580
Calm down and sit down!

00:52:55.000 --> 00:52:56.370
Now is the time

00:52:56.460 --> 00:52:59.210
It's time for Jin Ho Kyung to intervene and resolve the dispute

00:53:08.590 --> 00:53:11.680
Enough!

00:53:14.060 --> 00:53:16.600
- I'll deal with you later!
- Well, come on!

00:53:16.680 --> 00:53:18.230
Consider yourself lucky

00:53:19.020 --> 00:53:19.900
I'll continue

00:53:21.100 --> 00:53:23.020
Based on the general opinion,

00:53:23.110 --> 00:53:25.150
We'd better use the ice stone

00:53:25.230 --> 00:53:29.200
For the benefit of all present

00:53:30.410 --> 00:53:31.490
Therefore I

00:53:31.570 --> 00:53:36.120
Jin Ho Kyung, the head of Jinyoewon, I would like to propose the following

00:53:36.200 --> 00:53:39.580
From now on, the right to convene the Unified Council

00:53:40.250 --> 00:53:44.180
will be owned by Jinyeowon, not Sosnovy Bor

00:53:49.230 --> 00:53:51.940
If everyone agrees with this proposal,

00:53:52.020 --> 00:53:53.860
we'll finish here

00:53:53.940 --> 00:53:57.530
Now Jinyeowon will conduct all discussions regarding the stone,

00:53:58.400 --> 00:54:00.950
not Sosnovy Bor

00:54:06.660 --> 00:54:08.160
I will consider this as consent

00:54:08.250 --> 00:54:10.000
and I'll end today's meeting

00:54:11.870 --> 00:54:15.250
The ice stone will remain in Jinyeowon

00:54:16.460 --> 00:54:18.010
We must destroy the stone

00:54:18.920 --> 00:54:22.970
This way we will prevent future quarrels

00:54:23.050 --> 00:54:25.510
What gives you the right to make such a decision?

00:54:25.600 --> 00:54:26.930
Everyone present is against

00:54:27.010 --> 00:54:30.060
A case of soul alchemy has been recorded

00:54:30.140 --> 00:54:32.520
And all because of reflectors made of stone

00:54:32.600 --> 00:54:34.730
At first they doubted Jeonbugwan and the royal family

00:54:34.810 --> 00:54:37.150
Now you do the same with Jinyeowon

00:54:38.730 --> 00:54:42.030
I won't let the Unified Council end like this.

00:54:43.570 --> 00:54:44.740
Head Jin,

00:54:44.820 --> 00:54:50.830
I forbid you to take the ice stone out of Sosnovy Bor

00:54:50.910 --> 00:54:54.040
Are you going to go against everyone?

00:54:54.120 --> 00:54:55.500
Nobody

00:54:56.670 --> 00:54:59.050
will not take the ice stone from Sosnovy Bor

00:55:08.230 --> 00:55:09.650
We will use force against anyone

00:55:11.070 --> 00:55:13.280
who will try to do this

00:55:17.240 --> 00:55:19.280
Then the war will begin

00:55:27.580 --> 00:55:29.290
The situation has reached its peak

00:55:29.380 --> 00:55:31.210
Your Majesty, you should intervene

00:55:31.920 --> 00:55:34.260
Master Li was right

00:55:34.340 --> 00:55:37.050
Everyone wanted to get the stone, so strife began

00:55:37.140 --> 00:55:38.720
That's why the stones were destroyed

00:55:40.680 --> 00:55:42.600
Everyone is fighting over a stone

00:55:43.270 --> 00:55:44.480
So, the King's star...

00:55:44.560 --> 00:55:46.900
also true

00:56:31.530 --> 00:56:34.410
I see all my former teachers are here

00:56:35.200 --> 00:56:38.040
Let your former student greet you

00:56:39.000 --> 00:56:40.750
Who is this young man?

00:56:40.830 --> 00:56:42.090
This is Chan Wook

00:56:42.170 --> 00:56:44.960
An ignoramus from the Chan family. He was also my student

00:56:45.840 --> 00:56:48.260
If I'm not confused, then your family also tried to teach him

00:56:48.880 --> 00:56:51.300
Exactly. He ran away after three days

00:56:51.390 --> 00:56:54.510
Sorry to interrupt your passionate discussion.

00:56:55.100 --> 00:56:57.850
the beat of a drum

00:57:00.600 --> 00:57:03.360
- Should I stop him?
- Let him speak

00:57:03.940 --> 00:57:06.990
He managed to stop their battles

00:57:07.690 --> 00:57:09.320
Chang Wook, son of Chang Gang

00:57:11.410 --> 00:57:14.490
I hope you have a good reason for ranting like that.

00:57:14.580 --> 00:57:16.830
before His Majesty

00:57:21.040 --> 00:57:23.460
I have come to announce the will of Master Seo Kyung

00:57:34.640 --> 00:57:37.100
I revealed to him the teacher's true intentions

00:57:37.180 --> 00:57:38.930
I hope he acts wisely

00:57:45.030 --> 00:57:48.660
I speak on behalf of Master Lee, student of Seo Kyung

00:57:48.750 --> 00:57:51.040
So I hope everyone will show respect...

00:57:51.120 --> 00:57:53.000
and listen to the will of Master So

00:58:01.680 --> 00:58:03.760
According to Master Li,

00:58:03.840 --> 00:58:06.300
Master Seo Kyung's will regarding the stone

00:58:06.390 --> 00:58:08.100
written in "Words of the Heart"

00:58:10.600 --> 00:58:12.980
There he explained why he did not destroy the stone,

00:58:13.060 --> 00:58:15.650
and left the book to all the magicians so that everyone knows

00:58:15.730 --> 00:58:18.940
Pine forest did not hide anything

00:58:22.070 --> 00:58:25.570
Most of those present read "Words of the Heart"

00:58:26.070 --> 00:58:29.790
Our duty is to find the will of Master Seo Kyung in the book

00:58:32.620 --> 00:58:34.290
Do you remember what it was about?

00:58:34.370 --> 00:58:37.040
No, I read it a long time ago

00:58:37.130 --> 00:58:38.800
Do you want to say that in this poem...

00:58:38.880 --> 00:58:40.920
did he write why he left the stone?

00:58:42.720 --> 00:58:43.800
That's right

00:58:43.880 --> 00:58:47.470
I was told that everyone follows the tenets of Master Seo Kyung

00:58:47.550 --> 00:58:50.020
Therefore, you need to argue not about an ice stone,

00:58:50.100 --> 00:58:52.350
and about the meaning of “Words of the Heart”

00:58:52.430 --> 00:58:55.560
Where are those “Words of the Heart” that he talks about?

00:58:56.270 --> 00:58:58.060
This poem was kept in Sosnovy Bor,

00:58:58.150 --> 00:59:02.040
but by order of Master Li, we recently sent her to Jinyeowon

00:59:03.750 --> 00:59:06.330
It is kept in Jinyowon

00:59:06.420 --> 00:59:08.540
Then bring the book here

00:59:10.670 --> 00:59:11.840
Yes

00:59:20.260 --> 00:59:21.930
I'm Jin Cho Young from Jinyoung

00:59:22.720 --> 00:59:24.600
I'll bring "Words of the Heart"

00:59:25.270 --> 00:59:27.020
Previously, the book was kept with us,

00:59:27.100 --> 00:59:29.270
I'll send someone too

00:59:30.020 --> 00:59:32.570
Park Dan Goo, go with her

00:59:38.490 --> 00:59:39.660
Let's go

00:59:55.550 --> 00:59:56.680
I've been for a long time

00:59:57.590 --> 01:00:01.350
I haven’t re-read “Words of the Heart”

01:00:01.430 --> 01:00:03.560
Can you remind me what it's about?

01:00:03.640 --> 01:00:05.850
Just a short poem

01:00:07.060 --> 01:00:09.480
It turns out that Uk is lying?

01:00:09.560 --> 01:00:11.650
It doesn't say anything about ice stone

01:00:12.400 --> 01:00:16.490
I don’t understand why he suddenly started talking about “Words of the Heart”

01:00:19.530 --> 01:00:22.040
What's in these "Words of the Heart"?

01:00:22.130 --> 01:00:23.500
I don't know either

01:00:24.590 --> 01:00:28.380
I think he's bluffing. Wants to buy time

01:00:28.930 --> 01:00:31.220
But this book was written by Seo Kyung himself

01:00:31.930 --> 01:00:34.640
We have almost undermined trust in Sosnovy Bor

01:00:34.720 --> 01:00:37.060
What if everything turns out to be in vain?

01:00:39.690 --> 01:00:42.940
Master, they seem to be angry

01:00:43.020 --> 01:00:45.190
And soon they will be very surprised

01:00:46.070 --> 01:00:47.280
But for this

01:00:48.280 --> 01:00:49.530
I need his help

01:01:02.290 --> 01:01:04.500
It's just a poem

01:01:05.590 --> 01:01:07.460
Is there some hidden meaning in it?

01:01:08.880 --> 01:01:10.050
I don't know

01:01:11.090 --> 01:01:13.760
Maybe he used the book to buy time

01:01:14.390 --> 01:01:16.350
If this is the case,

01:01:16.850 --> 01:01:18.640
I need to help him

01:01:19.310 --> 01:01:20.270
Let's hurry up

01:01:20.940 --> 01:01:22.100
Wait...

01:01:22.190 --> 01:01:25.020
I'm terribly hungry. Is there anything to eat here?

01:01:26.110 --> 01:01:27.820
I didn't even have time to have breakfast

01:01:28.490 --> 01:01:31.740
Are you deliberately trying to buy time for Sosnovy Bor?

01:01:34.820 --> 01:01:37.740
Do you want to go back and watch everyone get crazy again?

01:01:37.830 --> 01:01:39.870
I don't have time to argue

01:01:39.950 --> 01:01:41.470
Mother and sister are waiting

01:01:42.300 --> 01:01:43.760
Cho Young

01:01:45.300 --> 01:01:46.810
Are you sure

01:01:47.850 --> 01:01:49.680
that this is your real sister?

01:01:51.350 --> 01:01:52.390
And what?

01:01:52.480 --> 01:01:57.770
The real culprit behind the murders Moo Deok was accused of

01:01:57.860 --> 01:01:59.570
girl named So Yi

01:02:02.030 --> 01:02:03.950
The girl you call sister

01:02:05.320 --> 01:02:06.620
the same So Yi

01:02:08.910 --> 01:02:10.080
What?

01:02:29.390 --> 01:02:33.180
I heard you told Cho Young that you don't like this girl

01:02:35.900 --> 01:02:37.020
Yes

01:02:38.900 --> 01:02:40.980
She gives off bad energy

01:02:41.070 --> 01:02:43.860
I don't want her to come near me again

01:02:49.870 --> 01:02:52.290
I'll make sure you're always safe

01:02:53.120 --> 01:02:54.410
I'll get rid of her

01:03:00.680 --> 01:03:02.270
Thank you, mother

01:03:30.040 --> 01:03:31.340
She has changed

01:03:32.210 --> 01:03:33.880
Does she know it's a change?

01:03:35.300 --> 01:03:37.300
Do they use it knowing it is fake?

01:03:39.550 --> 01:03:42.310
Why are you stalling for time, hiding behind a poem?

01:03:46.310 --> 01:03:49.310
Chronicle of Jeonbugwan

01:03:52.020 --> 01:03:53.690
Fifth of May

01:03:53.780 --> 01:03:55.940
When Gwangju Chang Gang tried to catch Shaman Choi,

01:03:56.030 --> 01:03:58.700
in order to convict her of using dark magic,

01:03:58.780 --> 01:04:01.280
she jumped into the fire

01:04:01.370 --> 01:04:03.120
Listed dead

01:04:04.580 --> 01:04:06.580
The story of the shaman Bon from the village of Gema

01:04:07.330 --> 01:04:08.670
preserved in the records

01:04:09.250 --> 01:04:13.090
Perhaps shaman Choi and Jin Mu met then

01:04:13.170 --> 01:04:16.300
Why are you so persistently looking for this shaman Choi?

01:04:16.380 --> 01:04:19.800
Have you found the house that Eunuch Kim visited in Gema?

01:04:21.190 --> 01:04:22.520
Yes

01:04:23.020 --> 01:04:25.690
He often went to the herb shop

01:04:25.780 --> 01:04:27.150
A shop, you mean?

01:04:27.780 --> 01:04:30.360
I shared it with you. Now it's your turn

01:04:31.950 --> 01:04:33.120
Eunuch Kim

01:04:33.950 --> 01:04:36.370
called the person he served shaman Choi

01:04:40.250 --> 01:04:42.170
The man whom Eunuch Kim served...

01:04:42.250 --> 01:04:44.000
Her Majesty the Queen

01:04:46.550 --> 01:04:48.670
I know you suspected her yourself

01:04:48.760 --> 01:04:51.630
The soul of the real queen still lives

01:04:52.470 --> 01:04:55.310
Most likely she is located where eunuch Kim went

01:04:56.260 --> 01:04:58.100
How do you know she's alive?

01:05:03.150 --> 01:05:05.610
The Queen's Lantern of Life still burns

01:05:05.690 --> 01:05:07.530
She is a member of the So family

01:05:08.190 --> 01:05:09.530
I will find the real queen...

01:05:09.610 --> 01:05:12.660
and I will reveal the true essence of the one who is now sitting on the Unified Council

01:05:17.660 --> 01:05:20.040
Do you want to involve me in this?

01:05:20.120 --> 01:05:22.290
This concerns your mother

01:05:28.000 --> 01:05:29.300
And with a stone

01:05:29.380 --> 01:05:31.510
what will you do then?

01:05:31.590 --> 01:05:33.470
As Master Seo Kyung bequeathed

01:05:33.550 --> 01:05:35.470
I will do as it is written in “Words of the Heart”

01:05:35.550 --> 01:05:36.430
Uk

01:05:37.390 --> 01:05:39.610
Words of the Heart Doesn't Talk About Stone

01:05:39.690 --> 01:05:43.320
I thought you were lying to buy time

01:05:43.400 --> 01:05:44.740
I didn't lie

01:05:45.450 --> 01:05:47.120
The reason is really

01:05:47.200 --> 01:05:50.120
painted in a poem by master Seo Kyung

01:05:55.460 --> 01:05:58.130
The ice stone contains Hwangsu's power. Right?

01:05:58.210 --> 01:06:00.840
It contains the powers that control water, fire and wind.

01:06:00.920 --> 01:06:03.840
And also the power that controls the souls of people

01:06:04.800 --> 01:06:05.890
Therefore his strength

01:06:05.970 --> 01:06:08.180
should be banned for humanity

01:06:08.260 --> 01:06:11.560
It's hard to believe that such a small piece of ice

01:06:11.640 --> 01:06:12.810
so much power

01:06:12.890 --> 01:06:14.390
I want to see for myself

01:06:18.480 --> 01:06:21.280
Have any of you seen the stone in action?

01:06:24.320 --> 01:06:27.950
Did you really fight over a piece of ice whose strength you didn’t even see?

01:06:31.040 --> 01:06:32.660
Then... maybe we'll check

01:06:33.790 --> 01:06:36.080
Let's test his strength in front of everyone?

01:06:36.870 --> 01:06:38.920
How exactly do you want to do this?

01:06:39.000 --> 01:06:40.210
If he controls souls,

01:06:40.920 --> 01:06:43.590
So it can bring the dead back to life?

01:06:45.090 --> 01:06:47.800
Hwangsu is not witchcraft, there is no ban on it

01:06:47.890 --> 01:06:49.600
Yes, we’ll bring back the dead, it’s a good thing

01:06:51.350 --> 01:06:52.850
Head Jin, you brought the stone here,

01:06:54.140 --> 01:06:55.600
show his strength

01:06:57.060 --> 01:06:58.400
Your Majesty,

01:06:58.480 --> 01:07:01.530
everyone here is alive. Who do you propose to resurrect?

01:07:02.950 --> 01:07:04.620
Then kill someone

01:07:10.540 --> 01:07:11.420
Here you are

01:07:14.880 --> 01:07:17.050
Come here

01:07:19.340 --> 01:07:20.260
Yes

01:07:25.600 --> 01:07:27.230
Kill her and bring her back to life

01:07:27.810 --> 01:07:29.350
She's a maid and doesn't know any spells

01:07:29.940 --> 01:07:33.150
Therefore, you don’t have to worry about letting her near the ice stone.

01:07:33.230 --> 01:07:34.070
Your Majesty,

01:07:34.150 --> 01:07:36.530
You can't kill a person just out of curiosity

01:07:36.610 --> 01:07:38.490
I just want to see her come to life

01:07:39.070 --> 01:07:39.950
with this

01:07:40.030 --> 01:07:42.080
How can you ask a weak girl...

01:07:42.160 --> 01:07:44.450
experience this?

01:07:48.080 --> 01:07:49.170
Answer

01:07:50.250 --> 01:07:51.540
Are you scared?

01:07:55.090 --> 01:07:56.590
I will pay you 100 gold nyans

01:07:57.300 --> 01:07:58.630
What do you say?

01:08:02.010 --> 01:08:03.100
Okay

01:08:03.890 --> 01:08:05.060
I agree

01:08:06.470 --> 01:08:07.600
I'll sacrifice myself

01:08:08.350 --> 01:08:11.900
to show the strength they want to see

01:08:12.980 --> 01:08:14.860
everyone present

01:08:43.310 --> 01:08:45.690
Here's my chance to get the ice stone

01:08:47.440 --> 01:08:51.950
To do this I must first die

01:08:53.660 --> 01:08:57.660
No one here cares whether I die or not

01:08:58.910 --> 01:09:01.500
They're just curious to see

01:09:02.000 --> 01:09:03.960
the power of the stone

01:09:24.350 --> 01:09:26.520
I can't know if I'll die...

01:09:27.020 --> 01:09:30.820
or I will get my strength back thanks to the stone

01:09:32.070 --> 01:09:34.160
I'm standing on the edge of a cliff

01:09:35.110 --> 01:09:38.160
and in front of me is an ice stone

01:09:38.240 --> 01:09:39.750
I missed you too

01:09:43.050 --> 01:09:44.050
Here's my answer

01:09:45.220 --> 01:09:48.640
I'm glad you're not here

01:09:49.810 --> 01:09:52.560
"Words of the Heart" talks about the desire to save a loved one

01:09:53.140 --> 01:09:55.190
This is a letter from Master Seo Kyung

01:09:55.270 --> 01:09:57.690
dedicated to a dying loved one

01:09:57.770 --> 01:10:00.610
He wrote that he left something that would help keep his beloved close

01:10:00.690 --> 01:10:02.440
Do you want to say that you are a great hero,

01:10:03.360 --> 01:10:05.780
destroying stones to save the world,

01:10:05.860 --> 01:10:09.080
wanted to use it to save someone?

01:10:09.160 --> 01:10:11.240
The letter reflects the madness and pain of a person,

01:10:11.910 --> 01:10:14.540
ready to go against the laws of nature in order to save his beloved

01:10:15.370 --> 01:10:20.380
"Words of the Heart" is the confession of Master Seo Kyung

01:10:25.260 --> 01:10:28.010
I don't like it either

01:10:29.800 --> 01:10:32.180
So I'll kill you painlessly

01:10:33.890 --> 01:10:36.230
This is not to show my death

01:10:37.520 --> 01:10:39.560
We do this to show how I will be resurrected

01:10:43.190 --> 01:10:44.610
Revive me

01:10:45.650 --> 01:10:47.240
And don't disappoint anyone

01:10:49.280 --> 01:10:50.990
Then let's not disappoint anyone

01:10:54.660 --> 01:10:56.790
Mother kills her own daughter

01:11:52.940 --> 01:11:54.110
My beauty

01:11:55.610 --> 01:11:57.400
My Boo Young

01:12:06.240 --> 01:12:07.370
Mother

01:12:48.660 --> 01:13:01.390
Thanks for watching with us!
doramamania

01:13:02.800 --> 01:13:05.810
Alchemy

01:13:02.800 --> 01:13:05.810
Shower

01:13:06.900 --> 01:13:08.360
Something went wrong

01:13:08.440 --> 01:13:09.940
Did something happen to the ice stone?

01:13:10.030 --> 01:13:13.400
When we approached the gate, a strong wind knocked us off our feet

01:13:13.490 --> 01:13:15.200
This definitely happened because of Moo Deok

01:13:16.070 --> 01:13:17.700
The children are there!

01:13:17.780 --> 01:13:18.830
Young Ok!

01:13:18.910 --> 01:13:21.080
My energy just came out through the sword

01:13:21.160 --> 01:13:23.290
I think the problem is the barrier

01:13:23.370 --> 01:13:25.250
Has Master Kang disappeared?

01:13:26.420 --> 01:13:30.090
None of us can cast spells here. Why does he succeed?

01:13:30.170 --> 01:13:31.920
We can't all die

01:13:32.010 --> 01:13:34.010
I will lure him and lock him in a secret room

01:13:34.090 --> 01:13:35.680
Chan Wook might die

01:13:36.220 --> 01:13:39.360
If the room is locked, he's probably already dead.

01:13:41.070 --> 01:13:42.690
Chan Wook, my student...
